éance en 2 blocs. Le premier est composé de 4 séries de 3 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le second est composé de 4 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause à la spécifité que les durées et répétitions diminuent de série en série et que l'intensité diminue. Prend 2'  de récupération entre les séries. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Garde en tête que les résultats du renforcement ne se voient pas du jour au lendemain. La régularité et la patience sont les meilleurs alliés de ta progression.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":12,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Fente arrière","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"hb4BQg4cqbEo2jFyobgiiaVMM9Lvq227","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730151937-dsc3692.png","muxPlaybackId":"K3t4gDQOM02dAnQYrsSalA01mNjkty8xiu","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"Xh02xvMtrbJimagSnxQkz00TA2tvuktddc","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393345-dsc4097.png","muxPlaybackId":"sWHMMIyy4h2UCt1nRa02ESjPpivqnf018d","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Split Squat avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393398-dsc4101.png","muxPlaybackId":"dic02Ysz02AmD200oMRCvd900hIc3lw01Jh85","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730393398-dsc4101.png","muxPlaybackId":"jhDR01T1PHx5t1KEXnb2U1G2Hcejfp01IY","format":"mobi